# The repository-root .gitignore treats MANIFEST as a MakeMaker build output
# (`make manifest` can regenerate one). For this distribution it is a real
# source file: it is what makes `make dist` ship share/schema/*.schema.json,
# the twenty-one vendored JSON Schemas the binding needs to validate anything
# without a repository checkout. Un-ignore it so a fresh clone packs correctly.
!MANIFEST
